+## Agent form tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up pages expose `sign-in` and `sign-up` through the
+[WebMCP Declarative API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api)
+in supporting browsers. Both tools accept the required `username` and `password`
+fields. Sign-up requires a password with at least eight characters and a number.
+
+These account forms omit `toolautosubmit`, so the user reviews and submits the
+filled form. The existing client-side handlers send the request and return the
+same success or failure message to the agent via `SubmitEvent.respondWith`.
+Passwords and authentication tokens are not included in tool results. Tools are
+available while their forms are mounted; unsupported browsers retain the usual
+form behavior.
